rofits, or Buy More?","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNREt0NjFNN3lvNTlvdWxTX0ZaaVNiclpidmx2Z09Ca2FpZXdlRjVNbndoNjY1Vm5neFNISXUzeURpRlFJRnc5ZFFMQzR1YjBqREdabnpZbFBCUmVTTkRLWnpnQWthZ3VSZ2VZX0k0cEt6d2tpNkFjWkR5bEZHLVA1Z09kWUpWbC1DVUF3Vw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Zscaler 一個月內上漲 14%：獲利了結，還是買更多？"},{"title":"Should Reaffirmed 2027 Outlook Require Action From Zscaler Stock Investors?","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"重申的 2027 年展望是否需要 Zscaler 股票投資者採取行動？"},{"title":"Zscaler Stock Slid 8% This Week and Sits 38% Below Its High. Here’s What Comes Next","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPUVVZRDlZMHJIS3c2dTMxTVdiYjJ5X0xiQ01GM3Q3YnRFNGF6Vl9hVHdHWHh3cE13eUN5UC1jNUcybjlCZXlJdzBVQkxXajZaZTdycDhxUkVrRVZpV1d3cHdWQXNGUnJGQ2IxZU1FQndBSHFMWHdqNDZtN0VUWTZnYXV4ekFiZ0hDOGN5X0xDMEhfbDlQbFI5RXpsTUNpQk0wY2VXVnR0Q2Q?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Zscaler 股價本週下跌 8%，較高點低 38%。接下來會發生什麼"},{"title":"Zscaler (ZS) Reaffirms Guidance As A Rich Valuation Narrative Comes Back Into View","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"隨著豐富的估值敘述重新出現，Zscaler (ZS) 重申指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-09-03","period":"2026-07-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1713683/000171368326000157/zs-20260731.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are the cybersecurity platform for the AI era. We empower our customers with the cybersecurity solutions necessary to protect their enterprises, drive growth and outpace competitors where success depends on securely adopting the technologies required to operate and compete effectively in an AI world. We were founded in 2007, based on a vision that, with the broad adoption of SaaS applications, the internet would become the new corporate network, the cloud would become the new data center and perimeter-based security would fail to protect users, applications and data. As AI redefines how businesses operate, and powerful AI-enabled cyberthreats proliferate, enterprises must now adopt a zero trust approach to security. We deliver a comprehensive, cloud-native zero trust platform that minimizes the attack surface of an enterprise and eliminates lateral threat movement, enabling security a","zh":"我們是人工智慧時代的網路安全平台。我們為客戶提供必要的網路安全解決方案，以保護他們的企業、推動成長並超越競爭對手，而成功取決於安全地採用在人工智慧世界中有效運作和競爭所需的技術。我們成立於 2007 年，我們的願景是，隨著 SaaS 應用程式的廣泛採用，互聯網將成為新的企業網路，雲端將成為新的資料中心，基於邊界的安全將無法保護用戶、應用程式和資料。隨著人工智慧重新定義企業營運方式，以及強大的人工智慧網路威脅激增，企業現在必須採用零信任的安全方法。我們提供全面的雲端原生零信任平台，最大限度地減少企業的攻擊面並消除橫向威脅移動，從而使安全性成為可能"},{"en":"The traditional model of enterprise security built around hub-and-spoke networks, firewalls and virtual private networks, or VPNs, was designed to protect a fixed perimeter. With rapid and increasing cloud adoption, workforce mobility and the emergence of an autonomous agentic workforce, traditional perimeter security fails to completely secure the modern enterprise, is prohibitively expensive and delivers poor user experience. These outdated yet widely-deployed tools are preventing enterprises from safely embracing the digital transformation that is necessary to compete today.","zh":"圍繞中心輻射網路、防火牆和虛擬私人網路（VPN）建構的傳統企業安全模型旨在保護固定邊界。隨著雲端技術的快速普及、勞動力流動性以及自主代理勞動力的出現，傳統的外圍安全無法完全保護現代企業，而且成本高且使用者體驗不佳。這些過時但廣泛部署的工具正在阻礙企業安全地接受當今競爭所需的數位轉型。"},{"en":"Enterprises have moved applications from the data center to the cloud, workforce mobility has dissolved the office perimeter and enterprises must securely access applications and data, wherever they are hosted, from any device, anywhere in the world. The emergence and rapid adoption of AI have accelerated this transformation, with AI agents accessing applications, AI models and data at machine speed and creating new governance and data security challenges that legacy tools were not built to address.","zh":"企業已將應用程式從資料中心轉移到雲端，員工移動性已經消除了辦公室邊界，企業必須安全地存取應用程式和數據，無論它們託管在何處、透過任何設備、在世界任何地方。人工智慧的出現和快速採用加速了這一轉變，人工智慧代理以機器速度存取應用程式、人工智慧模型和數據，並帶來了傳統工具無法解決的新的治理和數據安全挑戰。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Although we have a channel sales model, we use a joint sales approach in which our sales force develops relationships directly with our customers, and together with our internal channel account teams, works with our partners on account penetration, account coordination, sales and overall market development. Our sales organization is account-centric, with dedicated sales and customer success resources. Our customer care and success teams maintain high-touch relationships with our customers to deploy and manage our cloud platform, identify, analyze and resolve performance issues and respond to security threats. We believe customer service touchpoints are opportunities to further develop our relationship with our customers and potentially generate incremental revenue through the addition of new users and services.","zh":"儘管我們有通路銷售模式，但我們採用聯合銷售方式，即我們的銷售人員直接與客戶建立關係，並與我們的內部通路客戶團隊一起，與我們的合作夥伴合作進行客戶滲透、客戶協調、銷售和整體市場開發。我們的銷售組織以客戶為中心，擁有專門的銷售和客戶成功資源。我們的客戶服務和成功團隊與客戶保持密切聯繫，以部署和管理我們的雲端平台，識別、分析和解決效能問題以及應對安全威脅。我們相信客戶服務接觸點是進一步發展我們與客戶關係的機會，並有可能透過增加新用戶和服務來產生增量收入。"},{"en":"Our channel partners consist of global telecommunications service providers, system integrators, value-added reseller partners and public cloud marketplaces, and we leverage their relationships to expand our reach, improve procurement and accelerate customer fulfillment.","zh":"我們的通路合作夥伴包括全球電信服務供應商、系統整合商、加值經銷商合作夥伴和公有雲市場，我們利用他們的關係來擴大我們的覆蓋範圍、改善採購並加速客戶履行。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The market for security solutions is defined by changing technologies, an evolving threat landscape and complex enterprise needs. Our competitors and potential competitors include legacy on-premises appliance vendors and other vendors across a number of categories:","zh":"安全解決方案市場是由不斷變化的技術、不斷變化的威脅情況和複雜的企業需求決定的。我們的競爭對手和潛在競爭對手包括傳統的本地設備供應商和多個類別的其他供應商："},{"en":"large networking, cloud service and other vendors, which offer security appliances and/or incorporate security capabilities in their products, platforms and other services;","zh":"大型網路、雲端服務和其他供應商，提供安全設備和/或在其產品、平台和其他服務中納入安全功能；"}],"segments":{},"peers":["OKTA","CRWD","DDOG","NET","PANW"]}}